From ff2aa18575d1b29351c083d6e5cde7eaa3fdf0f9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 23:41:26 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Clips: no repeated frames, no stretching 4:3 with black
 bars, links copied instantly

Ported from the old repo (the two changes made after this copy was taken):
- Window capture asks for twice the clip's frame rate, so 60 FPS clips don't get
  bursts of repeated frames.
- Stretched-resolution clips only stretch when the game really is stretched.
- Share link copies the link the moment the upload starts; the clip server's page
  already embeds in Discord while it finishes; the button becomes Copy link.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
